Thus overall assertion:

assert (0 <= index && index < \old(this.size())) => \forall int i; i > index && i < \old(this.size()) - 1; ( (this.get(i+1) == null && \old(this.get(i+1)) == null) || this.get(i).equals(\old(this.get(i+1))) );

